{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"仿射态射"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"代数几何","text":"代数几何"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"仿射态射"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>仿射态射是"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"版本的"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$, 若对任意仿射开集 $U\\subset Y$, 其原像 $X\\times_Y U$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":", 则称 $f$ 为<strong>仿射态射</strong>.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>仿射态射是"},{"Local":{"url":"局部性质","text":"目标上的局部性质"}},{"Plain":", 在"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":"下稳定.</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于仿射态射 $p\\colon Y\\to X$, 有 $p_*\\mathcal O_Y$为"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O_X$-代数, 且 $Y$ 到"},{"Local":{"url":"相对谱","text":"相对谱"}},{"Plain":"的典范的映射 $Y\\to\\operatorname{Spec}_X(p_*\\mathcal O_Y)$ 为同构.</p>\n<p><strong>推论</strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭嵌入"}},{"Plain":"都是仿射态射.</p>\n"}]}}